WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/features/admin/pages/RbacMatrixPage.tsx + its hook domain
  web/src/api/hooks/useRbacMatrix.ts. Provider-agnostic "who can do what" admin matrix:
    columns = roles (resolved from the upstream proxy groups header), rows = permissions (grouped by
    category), cells = allow (✓) / deny (–). Read-only by default; an Edit toggle flips cells into
    checkboxes; Save diffs the draft against the snapshot and PUTs only the changed cells.

    Render ladder (web early returns):
      matrixQuery.isLoading                 → <Spinner/>                       (rbac-loading)
      isRbacOpenMode(data)                  → GlassPanel "forward-auth required" (rbac-open-mode)
      isError || !data                      → AlertBanner load error + Retry    (rbac-load-error)
      payload.roles.length === 0            → <EmptyState/> "No roles configured"(rbac-empty)
      else                                  → summary GlassPanel + (submitError AlertBanner) + matrix GlassPanel
    Summary: <MyRolesPill> + <EffectivePill> + optional groups-header caption; Edit | (Cancel + Save({n})).
    Grid: sticky header (Permission + role columns); per-category group rows; permission rows
      (name + id); cells = renderCell (read ✓/– or edit checkbox).
  Hooks ported (same names at the Swift call sites): useRbacMatrix (GET /admin/rbac/matrix),
    useUpsertRbacCells (PUT /admin/rbac/matrix), isRbacOpenMode, diffMatrices.
  Helpers (reproduced verbatim — the contract): diffMatrices (union of both snapshots' keys, default
    false on the missing side); snapshotToDraft (shallow row copy); permsByCategory + ordered
    categories (payload.categories || encounter order). No display-unit-bearing field → no SI
    conversion (S5).
  KMP parity: the shared core already ports this domain verbatim in
    apps/shared/core/.../presentation/rbacmatrix/{RbacMatrixModels,RbacMatrixStore}.kt (ADR-004); the
    native `RbacMatrixSource` seam mirrors `RbacMatrixStore` (matrix StateFlow → onUpdate, isOpenMode
    fold, upsertCells → upsert+refresh, diffMatrices).
  i18n: every visible literal is a t('rbac.*', 'default') call; all 23 keys promoted to the platform
    catalog (Localizable.xcstrings) with the web English default as the fallback.

